      "en": {
         "seven_days": "The figure above shows the forecast for the 7-day interval between 03/26/2025 e 04/01/2025, forecast of positive rainfall anomalies (blue) concentrated in isolated areas over the Aripuanã, Beni, Coari, Javari, Ji-Paraná, Mamoré, Marañon river basins, the basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast of the state of Amazonas and the northeast and northwest of the state of Pará, Tapajós and Ucayali. Rainfall deficit forecast (orange) for the Iriri, Jutaí, Tefé, Xingu and main course Solimões river basins. Rainfall close to climatology (white) in the other basins.",
         "fourteen_days": "The figure above shows the prognosis for the 14-day interval between 03/26/2025 e 04/08/2025, forecast of positive precipitation anomalies (blue) concentrated over a large part of the monitored region, over the main course of the Amazon River in Brazilian and Peruvian territory, the hydrographic basins of the Abacaxis, Beni, Branco, Coari, Curuá Una, Içá, Japurá, Javari, Juruá, Madeira, Mamoré, Marañon, basins on the left bank of the Amazon River in the northeast of the state of Amazonas and the northeast and northwest of the state of Pará, Napo, Negro, Tapajós, Tefé, Ucayali and the main course of the Solimões River. Rainfall deficit forecast (orange) in isolated areas over the Guaporé, Iriri, Juruena, Teles Pires and Xingu river basins. Rainfall close to climatology (white) over the other basins."
